Available Endpoints:
Production APIs (For Frontend Dashboard):
text
POST   /api/documents/upload          # Upload PDF or image
GET    /api/documents                 # List all documents
GET    /api/documents/{id}            # Get document by ID
GET    /api/documents/search?query=   # Search documents
GET    /api/documents/stats           # Get statistics
GET    /api/documents/health          # Health check
Testing APIs (For Developers):
text
POST   /api/documents/test/process     # Test single image with debug
POST   /api/documents/test/upload      # Test PDF/image with debug
GET    /api/documents/test/info        # Testing API information
Invoice APIs (Existing):
text
POST   /api/v1/upload                  # Upload invoice
GET    /api/v1/invoices                # List invoices
GET    /api/v1/invoices/{id}           # Get invoice by ID
GET    /api/v1/search                  # Search invoices
GET    /api/v1/stats                   # Get statistics
GET    /api/v1/health                  # Health check